OL,3,GNEWSAAldi to cut 150 jobs at head
OL,4,Aoffice
OL,5,
OL,6,FUp to 150 head office jobs could go at
OL,7,Fsupermarket chain Aldi as part of a
OL,8,Fshake-up of its UK business.
OL,10,FThe firm said it was consulting members
OL,11,Fof the technology team based at its
OL,12,Fheadquarters in Atherstone,
OL,13,FWarwickshire. Store-based jobs are
OL,14,Fbelieved to be unaffected.
OL,16,FThe move comes on top of about 103
OL,17,Fredundancies made within the finance
OL,18,Fand administration teams earlier this
OL,19,Fyear.
OL,23,APub: 11-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
