OL,3,GNEWSAAldi to cut 150 jobs at head
OL,4,Aoffice
OL,5,
OL,6,FIn a statement, Aldi said it
OL,7,Fcontinuously reviewed all aspects of
OL,8,Fits operation to ensure it operates
OL,9,Fsimply and efficiently to remain
OL,10,Fcompetitive.
